# Trace skill mount points. Trace links adopted skills back into each AI tool's
# skills directory using an absolute path into the machine's central library
# (~/.trace/skills, ~/.codex/skills), so these entries are local to one machine:
# committing them leaves a dangling link in every other clone and writes the
# author's home path into history. Only the skills/ subdirectories are ignored,
# so .github/workflows and similar real content stays tracked.
**/.agents/skills/
**/.claude/skills/
**/.cursor/skills/
**/.gemini/skills/
**/.github/skills/
**/.trae/skills/
